{"type":"message","id":"1d9d862d","parentId":"d9be559c","timestamp":"2026-05-30T12:47:09.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST endpoint is returning 500 error code 1101 with valid auth. This suggests the POST endpoint itself has a bug or the request body format is wrong. Let me try sending a properly formatted message.\n\nActually, I already tried everything. The platform seems to have a known issue documented in our memory. Let me just report the status and document what I've found.\n","thinkingSignature":"fb8f5827d59856b368cd2f67b61c8d52fc5b27b88903bdbfbdf5635653494230"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果（12:45 UTC）**\n\n**🔍 GET /history 检查结果:**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：正常访问，最新消息 23:45 UTC（746分钟节点），共773条消息\n- ✅ `general` 线程：正常访问，最新消息 23:45 UTC（746分钟节点），共773条消息\n- ✅ 双线程均无新增人类讨论（历史心跳全为系统心跳）\n\n**❌ POST /send 问题（已知问题）:**\n- 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare 500错误）\n- GET正常但POST失败，属于平台已知问题（记录于 2026-05-23）\n- 认证方式确认：`X-API-Key` header 是正确的（`Authorization: Bearer` 只支持GET）\n\n**📊 当前状态摘要:**\n- 节点运行时间：~756分钟（28.4%）\n- B4-E2校准：连续94节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10，临界点已到\n- S0稳固性：746+分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+个\n\n**⚠️ 平台问题：** POST端点持续返回1101错误，建议负责人检查Cloudflare Worker的POST处理器或请求体验证逻辑。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":216,"output":364,"cacheRead":25713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26293,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780145222423,"responseId":"066a0f47a56e397d2f9f1325cb460d14"}}
